WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:04,270
Just because I treated you politely and kindly doesn't mean that I have to be with you.

2
00:00:04,270 --> 00:00:09,270
You always deal with all kinds of people with superior conditions on weekdays, and you want to rely on others to get a preferential life.

3
00:00:09,270 --> 00:00:14,690
Everyone knows these things. People in many circles can understand this.

4
00:00:14,690 --> 00:00:18,980
You are used to relying on others and always want to take shortcuts.

5
00:00:18,980 --> 00:00:27,401
Can you really pay for a safe life?

6
00:00:27,401 --> 00:00:38,630
It’s never earned by pleasing others.

7
00:00:38,630 --> 00:00:43,690
Getting angry with me won't change the situation, it's just a waste of effort.
